Overleaf, and "Overleaf" is used only to say which site it works with.

Third-party material:

- extension/dist/core.wasm: the PhiTeX engine (partex: a pdfTeX-compatible
  engine, and PhiTeX's SSA crates), by the copyright holder above, and the
  Rust crates miniz_oxide (MIT OR Zlib OR Apache-2.0) and adler2 (0BSD OR
  MIT OR Apache-2.0).
- extension/dist/assets.bin.gz, read by the core:
  - pdflatex.fmt: a LaTeX format built from TeX Live 2026's LaTeX kernel
    (LaTeX Project Public License 1.3c) and Knuth's and TeX Live's
    hyphenation patterns, under their own terms.
  - .tfm/.vf/.enc and pdftex.map: TeX Live 2026's font metrics, virtual
    fonts, encodings and font map, unmodified, each under its own license
    (Computer Modern and AMS metrics: Knuth's and AMS's terms; others mostly
    LPPL, OFL or GPL with the font exception).
  - Type 1 fonts (.pfb), unmodified: Computer Modern (cm*, AMS/Blue Sky,
    SIL Open Font License 1.1), Latin Modern (lmr) and TeX Gyre Termes (qtmr)
    (GUST Font License), Linux Libertine (LinLibertine*, GPL-2.0 with the
    font exception, or OFL 1.1), CM-Super (sfrm, GPL-2.0-or-later with the
    font exception), Nimbus Roman (ztmr, URW, AGPL-3.0 with the font
    exception).
  - TeX Live 2026's LaTeX packages that common documents read (see texmf/
    below), unmodified.
- extension/fonts/*.otf: Latin Modern and Latin Modern Math (GUST e-foundry),
  GUST Font License, unmodified.
- extension/dist/pdfjs/: pdf.js (pdfjs-dist 5.7.284), Copyright Mozilla
  Foundation, Apache-2.0 (its LICENSE ships beside it).
- extension/src/panel.ts: approximateFraction, ported from pdf.js
  (pdfjs-dist, web/pdf_viewer.mjs), Copyright Mozilla Foundation,
  Apache-2.0.
- extension/src/panel.ts: icon paths from Google's Material Icons,
  Apache-2.0.
- The toolbar and popover markup the extension adds to Overleaf's page
  follows Overleaf's own (overleaf/overleaf, services/web/frontend),
  AGPL-3.0.

texmf/ (shipped as extension/texmf/): LaTeX packages from TeX Live 2026
(the LaTeX kernel and classes, l3kernel, graphics, tools, amsmath, hyperref,
...; texmf/MANIFEST.tsv lists each package and revision), unmodified, each
under its own license as stated in its files, mostly the LaTeX Project
Public License 1.3c. Packages not bundled are downloaded as needed from
Shelf (shelf-phitex.pages.dev), which serves TeX Live's files unmodified.
